 "body": {
  "text": "# Phase 2 vertical slice demo (F1.6a, F2.10): two independent branches run\n# concurrently, \"flaky\" is rejected by its Gate on attempt 1 and retried alone,\n# then a human node waits for approval before \"apply\" runs. No LLM involved.\n#   agentplane run .agents/graphs/demo-vertical.yaml --approve approve --watch\nschema_version: 0\nid: demo-vertical\ninputs: {}\nnodes:\n  fast:\n    type: shell\n    config:\n      command: /usr/bin/printf\n      args: [\"fast branch done\"]\n    outputs:\n      stdout: {type: string, required: true}\n  flaky:\n    type: shell\n    config:\n      command: /bin/sh\n      args:\n        - -c\n        - 'if [ \"$AGENTPLANE_ATTEMPT\" = 1 ]; then echo \"{\\\"ready\\\":false}\"; else echo \"{\\\"ready\\\":true}\"; fi'\n      stdout_json: true\n    outputs:\n      json: {type: json, required: true}\n    loop:\n      max_attempts: 3\n      gate:\n        inputs:\n          candidate: {type: json, required: true}\n        config:\n          check_id: flaky-ready\n          kind: json_predicate\n          input: candidate\n          field: [ready]\n          operator: eq\n          expected: true\n      bindings:\n        - {from: candidate.outputs.json, to: gate.inputs.candidate}\n  approve:\n    type: human\n    config:\n      prompt: Both branches are green. Approve applying the result?\n      context_inputs: [summary]\n    inputs:\n      summary: {type: string, required: true}\n      evidence: {type: json, required: true}\n    outputs:\n      decision: {type: string, required: true}\n  apply:\n    type: shell\n    config:\n      command: /usr/bin/printf\n      args: [\"applied\\n\"]\n    inputs:\n      decision: {type: string, required: true}\nedges:\n  - {from: fast.outputs.stdout, to: approve.inputs.summary}\n  - {from: flaky.outputs.json, to: approve.inputs.evidence}\n  - {from: approve.outputs.decision, to: apply.inputs.decision}\noutputs: {}\n",
  "hash": "b490cc946b8a83313fa69276d7da868a6d292c2660702787dc1ee46ef3f4e45a",
  "version": "sha256-v0:27fe87371c77b373a16f0ff07310c3812ede2ed3d9e4e8ab8b7f13a78a885c08",
  "definition": {
   "schema_version": 0,
   "id": "demo-vertical",
   "inputs": {},
   "nodes": {
